<%- include('partials/top', { title: 'Inbox' }) %>
<section class="to-hero">
  <p class="to-eyebrow">The office inbox</p>
  <h1>Inbox</h1>
  <p class="to-lede">Bookings, complaints, questions and the council all land here, the way they do in a real office. The AI reads each email and plain code passes it to the worker it belongs to: Bookings, Customer emails, Complaints or Licensing.</p>
  <form method="post" action="<%= BASE %>/inbox/check-all" class="to-inline-form">
    <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
    <button type="submit" class="to-btn to-btn-primary" data-busy="Reading the inbox...">Read the whole inbox</button>
    <span class="to-small">Takes a few seconds while the AI reads each one.</span>
  </form>
</section>

<% if (live) { %>
<section class="to-panel to-live" id="live" data-live-url="<%= BASE %>/inbox/live.json" data-live-count="<%= liveCount %>">
  <p class="to-worker-tag">Live: a real <%= live.label %> mailbox</p>
  <h2>Email one in from your phone</h2>
  <p>Send a booking, a complaint or a question to your own address for this demo. It usually lands here within a minute, and the AI reads it and passes it to its worker straight away.</p>
  <% var _at = live.address.indexOf('@'); %>
  <p class="to-live-address"><a href="mailto:<%= live.address %>?subject=Taxi%20booking"><%= live.address.slice(0, _at) %><wbr><%= live.address.slice(_at) %></a> <button type="button" class="to-btn to-btn-quiet" data-copy="<%= live.address %>">Copy</button></p>
  <p class="to-small" id="live-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"><%= live.ok ? (liveCount ? 'Send another and this page shows it when it arrives.' : 'Waiting for your email. This page updates by itself.') : 'The demo mailbox could not be read just now. The page keeps trying.' %></p>
  <p class="to-small">Only you see what you send to this address, and only until the demo starts again. Use made-up details: the email stays in the demo mailbox, and a reply you approve is saved there as a draft, never sent.</p>
</section>
<% } %>

<p class="to-connections"><span><strong>Mailbox:</strong> <%= conn.mailbox %></span><span class="to-small"><%= conn.mailboxDemo ? 'Made-up emails for this demo. On a live office this is the firm\'s own Gmail or Outlook inbox, read through its API, and a reply is saved as a draft in that inbox for someone to send.' : 'Replies are saved as drafts in this mailbox, on the same thread, for someone to send.' %></span></p>

<ul class="to-inbox" aria-label="Emails">
  <% emails.forEach(function (row) { var e = row.email; %>
    <li>
      <a href="<%= BASE %>/inbox/<%= e.id %>" class="to-inbox-row">
        <span class="to-inbox-from"><%= e.from.replace(/\s*<.*$/, '') %><% if (e.custom) { %> <span class="to-tag">Your test email</span><% } else if (e.live) { %> <span class="to-tag">Your email</span><% } %></span>
        <span class="to-inbox-subject"><%= e.subject %></span>
        <span class="to-inbox-when"><%= e.receivedAt.slice(0, 10) === today ? 'Today ' + e.receivedAt.slice(11) : shortDate(e.receivedAt.slice(0, 10)) + ' ' + e.receivedAt.slice(11) %></span>
        <span class="to-inbox-status"><% if (row.worker) { %><span class="to-chip"><%= WORKER[row.worker].name %></span> <% } %><span class="to-pill to-pill-<%= row.status.tone %>"><%= row.status.label %></span><% if (row.sent) { %> <span class="to-pill to-pill-ok">Replied</span><% } %></span>
      </a>
    </li>
  <% }) %>
</ul>

<section class="to-section to-panel" id="write">
  <h2>Try one of your own</h2>
  <p>Write an email the way a customer would: a booking, a complaint, a lost phone. Watch the AI read it, pass it to the right worker and check it against today's dispatch board. Use made-up details; places around Exmouth and Exeter work best.</p>
  <form method="post" action="<%= BASE %>/inbox/new" class="to-form">
    <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
    <div class="to-field-row">
      <label class="to-field"><span>From</span><input id="own-from" name="from" type="text" maxlength="120" placeholder="Sam Brown <sam@example.com>"></label>
      <label class="to-field"><span>Subject</span><input id="own-subject" name="subject" type="text" maxlength="160" placeholder="Taxi to the airport"></label>
    </div>
    <label class="to-field"><span>Email</span><textarea id="own-body" name="body" rows="6" maxlength="3000" required placeholder="Hi, can I book a car for 3 of us from Exmouth Marina to Exeter Airport on Friday at 6am? Two big cases. Sam, 07700 900450"></textarea></label>
    <button type="submit" class="to-btn to-btn-primary" data-busy="The AI is reading it...">Send it to the inbox</button>
    <p class="to-small">Up to <%= limit %> test emails an hour. What you write is read by the AI and emailed to nobody, and it is cleared when the demo starts again or after four hours.</p>
  </form>
</section>
<%- include('partials/bottom') %>
